  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large tagliere vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion, carrot, and celery and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the cornmeal and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the fish sauce, salt, and black pepper and stir to combine.",
    "Gradually add the chicken broth, stirring constantly to prevent lumps.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve the pilaf hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired.",
    "Cook poultry to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F before serving."
